<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Complete Management started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Complete Management started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Friend Weinress Frankson &amp; Presson analyst Steven Kornfeld said he started coverage of Complete Management Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the physician practice management firm closed Tuesday at 11-3/8.</p>
<p>-- &quot;CMI's strong cash position and high profit margins have laid the groundwork for excellent growth prospects,&quot; Kornfeld said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
